      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\n\nIn view of the IPL 2026 Day/Night match between Delhi Capitals vs Gujarat Titans at Arun Jaitley Stadium on 08.04.2026, traffic may be affected at nearby stretches.\n\nTime: 12:00 PM – 12:00 AM\n\n📍 LIKELY AFFECTED STRETCH\n•Bahadur Shah Zafar Marg\n•JLN Marg\n•Asaf Ali Road\n\n📍 Heavy/commercial vehicles will remain restricted on BSZ Marg & JLN Marg\n\n📍 Avoid JLN Marg, BSZ Marg & Asaf Ali Road, use alternate routes\n\n📍 Park & Ride facility available from Mata Sundari Road, Rajghat Power House Road & Velodrome Road\n\n📍 Plan your journey in advance to avoid inconvenience\n\n📍 Stay updated through Delhi Police Traffic channels\n\n#DPTrafficAdvisory",
